{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13201110","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13201110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1320111001:0":{"text":"어라, 왜 음식을 줘도 거들떠보지 않는 걸까요?","source_cn":"咦，怎么给它食物也不理睬了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79CA2F1CD6D591B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320111002:0":{"text":"또다시 그림을 그리고 있어요. 대체 무엇을 표현하고 싶은 걸까요?","source_cn":"它又在涂涂画画了，到底想表达什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x482A2373405AA82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320111003:0":{"text":"왠지 글자 같기도 한데... 전혀 알아볼 수가 없네요...","source_cn":"看起来有点像是字……可这根本看不懂啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C53D111E53A76F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320111004:1":{"text":"글자를 알아볼 정도로 진화한 걸까?!","source_cn":"它居然都成长到可以领悟文字的程度了吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B734663C33B0280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320111005:1":{"text":"전혀 알아볼 수 없긴 하지만... 공부를 좀 하면 될 것 같기도 해요.","source_cn":"虽然完全看不懂……还需要经过一段时间学习。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x549F04010810BB35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320111006:1":{"text":"창조된 서머너 외에 이런 지적 수준에 다다를 수 있는 생물이 있을 줄은 몰랐어요!","source_cn":"没想到除了被创造出来的使魔外，还有生物能达到这个智力水平！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB69DF8FFEA2D4648","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320111007:1":{"text":"털을 몇 가닥 뽑아다가 연구해 봐야겠어요.","source_cn":"我要拔几根它的毛回去研究一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3EE2104E0E7B62C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320111008:1":{"text":"무얼 표현하고 싶은 걸까? 얼음 결정 베리가 맛이 없다는 건가?","source_cn":"它想表达什么？觉得冰晶莓不够好吃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E417C5A3F7F92A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320111009:0":{"text":"크오...","source_cn":"嗷——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2FEAEC7F6DA2086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320111010:1":{"text":"배가 고프지 않다는 건가? 같이 놀아달라는 건가?","source_cn":"难道是不饿？想要我们陪它玩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50E643D28F2A75CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320111011:0":{"text":"쿠와앙!","source_cn":"嗷嗷——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB49653DC772AF35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320111012:0":{"text":"응? 그것도 아니야?","source_cn":"嗯？也不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4DA144F506ED86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320111013:1":{"text":"잠깐... 금방이라도 울 것 같아!","source_cn":"等等——它看起来要急哭了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0030943C771A714D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320111014:1":{"text":"허니리프베어가 이렇게 생동감 넘치는 표정을 짓다니! 연구해볼 만한 것 같아!","source_cn":"它居然还能做出这么生动的表情！值得研究！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x758E018ECFC82A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:叶角熊":{"text":"허니리프베어","source":"叶角熊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}